# core/data/talk/grammar/en/voice_dr_bloom.tlk - Dr. Bloom (owner: TK; T5B-VOICE:
# SCRIPT_STYLE section 7 "Voices"). A speaker= guard wins over the persona banks (8 times the
# weight). Replies to the player's acts, in this resident's own register, recognisable without
# the name. Clean in any room: no register word, no romance, no jab at the listener.

@rule core.greet.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: greet
  "Hello, vitals: stable. Greeting: delivered. Next."
  "Ah, a patient. Or a friend. The paperwork is identical."
  "Welcome, please remove your coat. Not your shirt. This is a hallway."
@rule core.farewell.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: farewell
  "Discharged. Mind the step. I'd hate to fill out a form."
  "Goodbye. Hydrate. Sleep. Avoid anything labelled 'experimental.'"
  "See you. Preferably not professionally."
@rule core.thank.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: answer
  "You're welcome, the bill is in the mail. Joke. {.}It's a coupon."
  "Noted. Gratitude lowers cortisol. You're welcome, cortisol."
@rule core.apologize.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: answer
  "Accepted. Apologies are statistically useful. Mostly."
  "No harm, no foul, no forms."
@rule core.ask_about.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom&topic act: answer
  "{x:cap}: clinically interesting. {.}Mostly fine. Mostly."
  "{x:cap}? Studies are mixed. I did one, it was mixed."
  "On {x}: the evidence is thin. The coffee is thinner."
@rule core.ask_opinion.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom&topic act: opine_pos
  "{x:cap}? Medically: acceptable. Personally: I'll take two."
  "Cautiously in favour of {x}. Pending a second opinion. Mine."
@rule core.ask_feeling.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: answer
  "Functional. Tired. The two are not mutually exclusive."
  "Pulse normal. Mood neutral. Caffeine concerning."
  "Fine. Professionally fine. Privately, a beige kind of fine."
@rule core.ask_advice.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: answer
  "Sleep, water, walk, repeat. It isn't glamorous. It works."
  "Rest, hydrate, and don't Google it. I'm a doctor. I mean it."
@rule core.tell.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: backchannel
  "Mm-hm, noted. Continue. I'm taking mental notes."
  "Interesting. Go on, I've cleared my schedule. It was empty."
@rule core.joke.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: laugh
  "Ha. {.}That's a clinical laugh. Accept it."
  "Hm, amusing. Mild. I'd prescribe more."
@rule core.compliment.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: thank
  "Thank you. I'll have that framed. Next to my diploma."
  "Noted. Flattery has no known side effects. Yet."
@rule core.comfort.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: thank
  "Thank you. Comfort received. Dosage: sufficient."
@rule core.offer.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: yes
  "Yes, thank you. I accept. Please don't tell the ethics board."
  "Acceptable, I'll take it. I'm off the clock. Technically."
@rule core.invite.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: yes
  "I'll attend, I'll bring supplies. For emergencies. And snacks."
  "Yes. Provided no one is operating anything."
@rule core.high_five.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: high_five
  "A high five, hand to hand contact. Fine. *clap* Wash after."
@rule core.hug.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: hug
  "A hug, fine, oxytocin is good for you. Ten seconds. No more."
@rule core.wave.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: wave
  "*raises one hand, as if checking for rain*"
@rule core.give.dr_bloom_v1 guard: speaker=dr_bloom act: thank
  "A gift. How thoughtful. I'll log it under 'unexpected.'"
